---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Major Support">
 
 <section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-primary-white relative overflow-hidden">
 
 <!-- Cute decorative blobs -->
 <div class="absolute top-20 right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-nav-periwinkle/30 rounded-full blur-2xl -z-10"></div>
 <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-10 w-80 h-80 bg-bg-lavender/50 rounded-full blur-[50px] -z-10"></div>
 
 <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
 
 <div class="text-center mb-16">
 <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-nav-periwinkle text-text-eggplant text-sm font-bold rounded-full mb-6 shadow-sm">
 Major Representatives
 </span>
 <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-text-eggplant mb-6 leading-tight">You don't have to <br/> do it alone.</h1>
 <p class="text-lg text-text-eggplant font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
 Navigating classes, internships, and career decisions can be overwhelming! That's why our SWE major representatives are here to support you. Whether you need to troubleshoot courses, review a resume, or just want some friendly peer advice — please reach out. We'd love to chat.
 </p>
 </div>

 <div class="bg-primary-white rounded-[3rem] p-8 md:p-12 shadow-xl shadow-purple-100/60 border-4 border-bg-lavender relative">
 
 <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-10">
 <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-bg-lavender rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-inner">
 <span class="text-2xl">☕️</span>
 </div>
 <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text-eggplant">Reach out to your rep:</h2>
